[
 {
  "line": "The most powerful air",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155606.974_175148630_1795794830227339.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "force on Earth just",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155607.213_696591984_1795794832205740.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "got hacked. And",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155607.584_116306141_1795794834739857.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "the attackers didn't need",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155607.792_107245526_1795794836476595.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "a single missile.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155607.989_418618640_1795794840839027.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "According to Reuters,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155608.211_870249519_1795794845559446.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "hackers broke into a cloud",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155608.380_358712259_1795794847141058.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "platform the {US|u s}",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155608.564_836646344_1795794848746165.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Air Force uses to manage",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155608.727_341307822_1795794850404146.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "military operations.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155608.815_411052351_1795794852092611.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Not a public website.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155608.931_828918861_1795794853990817.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "The system that helps plan",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155608.985_218747015_1795794855743166.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "and coordinate missions.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.054_553084307_1795794857641598.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Here's why that's terrifying.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.130_304655194_1795794859406706.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Modern militaries don't",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.227_799812661_1795794861218899.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "run on paper anymore.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.338_672995186_1795794862931136.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Flight schedules,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.429_934890704_1795794864780983.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "supply routes,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.521_304547036_1795794867463189.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "maintenance records,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.613_336167674_1795794869752962.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "even where aircraft",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.726_67367787_1795794871467044.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "are positioned.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.807_635877048_1795794873104917.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "A lot of it lives in the cloud.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.878_115866725_1795794874947184.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "So if someone gets inside,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155609.977_569252705_1795794876778680.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "they don't need to shoot down",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.042_473520625_1795794878605899.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "a jet. They can",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.134_417527451_1795794880270694.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "learn where it's going,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.213_881869560_1795794882036696.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "slow it down,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.520_661773484_1795794883801626.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "or quietly watch everything.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.606_641787212_1795794885441219.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "And this isn't the first",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.693_725667281_1795794887179998.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "warning. Just",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.771_42955042_1795794888879341.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "days ago,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.855_963111542_1795794890765629.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Homeland Security said",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155610.928_407165983_1795794892287691.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "America's critical infrastructure",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.007_362645196_1795794893819238.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "was under attack.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.082_802103460_1795794895506165.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Government agencies",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.157_284312513_1795794897597254.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "have been breached.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.230_999401614_1795794899392782.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "And Britain openly",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.350_531360453_1795794901448166.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "admits it's running cyber",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.428_116915937_1795794903181799.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "operations against Russia,",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.512_269915492_1795794904774081.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "China, Iran",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.601_925637014_1795794906987275.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "and North Korea.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.754_121664333_1795794908604097.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Officials haven't said",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.816_434718771_1795794910251439.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "who did it or",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.000_951995898_1795794914898828.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "what was taken.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155611.894_193321576_1795794912938913.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "But one thing is clear.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.185_363570642_1795794918073014.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "The next war might not",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.113_1055932696_1795794916495292.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "start with explosions.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.375_1062911413_1795794921328380.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "It might start with a login",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.286_835473891_1795794919757077.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "screen. So who do",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.472_9564633_1795794923234409.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "you think is behind it?",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.581_694892499_1795794925271918.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Tell me in the comments.",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.794_98885876_1795794928843841.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "If you want updates related",
  "image": "2026-11-27T155612.679_538997100_1795794926876466.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "to geopolitics and",
  "image": "zz1_cta.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "tech, then make sure to follow our page,",
  "image": "zz2_cta.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "Things Explained.",
  "image": "zz3_cta.png"
 }
]